  </div>

  <main class="wrap">

    <!-- ===== ATTRACT SCREEN / hero ===== -->
    <section class="attract" data-level="LV 00 ATTRACT">
      <div class="invaders" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="sprite" style={`--m:url("${invader}");background:var(--cyan)`}></span>
        <span class="sprite" style={`--m:url("${invader}");background:var(--mag)`}></span>
        <span class="sprite" style={`--m:url("${invader}");background:var(--yellow)`}></span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="logo pop"><span class="l1">SWAPNIL</span><span class="l2">BISWAS</span></h1>
      <div class="role pop">SENIOR PRODUCT MARKETING MANAGER &middot; LAMBDATEST</div>

      <div class="marquee pop" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="track">
          <span>THE PRODUCT MARKETER WHO <b>ENGINEERS</b> THE GROWTH &nbsp;&#9670;&nbsp; BUILDS THE AGENTS, SITES &amp; SEO SYSTEMS &nbsp;&#9670;&nbsp;</span>
          <span>THE PRODUCT MARKETER WHO <b>ENGINEERS</b> THE GROWTH &nbsp;&#9670;&nbsp; BUILDS THE AGENTS, SITES &amp; SEO SYSTEMS &nbsp;&#9670;&nbsp;</span>
        </div>
